`vendo completions <shell>` prints the TAB-completion script for bash, zsh or fish.
The installer saves it and sets up your shell to load it, so you rarely need to run it yourself.

Fish completions are not installed yet.

To install them, run the installer:
  curl -fsSL https://app2.vendodata.com/install.sh | bash
or save the script where fish loads it:
  vendo completions fish > ~/.config/fish/completions/vendo.fish
Then open a new terminal.
